{%- comment -%}
  Renders the body of /llms.txt — a markdown-formatted file that
  AI crawlers (ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini) read to
  understand the site's purpose, structure, and key content.

  The page using this section should be assigned a custom template
  page.llms.json. Then create a URL redirect /llms.txt -> /pages/llms
  in the Shopify admin so the file is served at the canonical
  /llms.txt path.

  llms.txt spec: https://llmstxt.org/
{%- endcomment -%}

